cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "GenoToolBoxPlus"
abstract: >
  GenoToolBoxPlus is a collection of lightweight, zero-dependency Python CLI
  utilities for genomics and genome annotation tasks. Scripts include FASTA
  renaming, FASTA statistics, and GFA-to-FASTA conversion. Each script uses
  the Python standard library only and runs in any Python 3.10+ environment
  without conda.
